ShaderNodeTexCoord "Coordinates": Generated read as object position
ShaderNodeTexNoise "Noise 4D": 4D noise read as 3D (W dropped)
ShaderNodeTexChecker "Checker": checked over x and y only
ShaderNodeVertexColor "Vertex Color": layer "Col" read as the first color set
ShaderNodeTexVoronoi "Voronoi Edge": feature DISTANCE_TO_EDGE read as F1
ShaderNodeTexVoronoi "Voronoi Sphere": Radius read as the F1 distance
ShaderNodeTexVoronoi "Voronoi Sphere": feature N_SPHERE_RADIUS read as F1
ShaderNodeTexCoord "Coordinates": Camera not available, zero
ShaderNodeTexCoord "Coordinates": Window not available, zero
ShaderNodeTexVoronoi "Voronoi Smooth": Color read as a gray cell noise
ShaderNodeTexCoord "Coordinates": Reflection not available, zero
